        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Relevant Recommendations"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1765532186703"
          },
          "code": "RELEVANT_RECOMMENDATIONS",
          "id": "1765515157784",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765515157785_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are provided with two JSON arrays:\n\ncourses: {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_LEARNING_ITEM_ENROLLMENT_STATUS.$output}}\ngigs: {{$context.$nodes.CHECK_IF_GIG_IS_VALID.$output}}\n\nYou also have a skillsGapArray: {{$context.$variables.missingSkills}}\n\nTask:\nIdentify and recommend upto 5 best matches (mix of learning courses and gigs) that address the highest number of skills from skillsGapArray. \nSuggest only unenrolled courses and gigs, If there are not enough valid items to suggest you can suggest less number of items. \nThe enrollment status of a course can be identified by hasEnrolled field in courses.\nDo not reccomend any gigs that have GigValidFlag=false or HasAppliedFlag=true.\n\nInstructions:\n\nFor each course and gig, consider all relevant descriptive fields to determine a match to the skills gap.\nCalculate a relevanceScore using the most relevant fields (for courses: learningItemDescription, liShortDescription, learningItemTitle; for gigs: Title, Description).\nDo not suggest any learning items with hasEnrolled = true\nFinal output should be JSON object with two properties :\n1. gigItems: array of objects\n2. learningItems: array of objects\n\nBased on type of selected item add it under learningItems or gigItems\norder the selected items by relevanceScore (could be courses, gigs, or a combination), and include only :\n1.learningItemId/OpportunityId\n2.relevanceScore\n3. explanation as to why its relevant\n\nfor the selected Item in the output\noutput should be in strict JSON"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"description\": \"\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"gigItems\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"uniqueItems\": true,\n      \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"required\": [\n          \"OpportunityId\",\n          \"relevanceScore\",\n          \"explanation\"\n        ],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"OpportunityId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          },\n          \"relevanceScore\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"explanation\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    \"learningItems\": {\n      \"type\": \"array\",\n      \"uniqueItems\": true,\n      \"minItems\": 1,\n      \"items\": {\n        \"required\": [\n          \"learningItemId\",\n          \"relevanceScore\",\n          \"explanation\"\n        ],\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"learningItemId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          },\n          \"relevanceScore\": {\n            \"type\": \"number\"\n          },\n          \"explanation\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"minLength\": 1\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"gigItems\",\n    \"learningItems\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Add attributes",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let gigItemsArray = $context.$nodes.RELEVANT_RECOMMENDATIONS.$output.gigItems || [];\nlet coursesArray = $context.$nodes.RELEVANT_RECOMMENDATIONS.$output.learningItems || [];\n\nvar finalObject={};\n\nconst courseItems = $context.$nodes.GET_MATCHING_LEARNING_COURSES.$output.items;\nconst gigItems = $context.$nodes.GET_MATCHING_GIGS.$output.items;\nconst itemMap = {};\n\ncourseItems.forEach(course => {\n    if (course.learningItemId !== undefined) {\n        delete course.learningItemThumbnailLink;\n        delete course.learningItemCoverArtLink;\n        delete course.learningItemDetailsDeepLink;\n        itemMap['COURSE'+course.learningItemId]= course;\n    }\n});\n\ngigItems.forEach(gig => {\n    if (gig.OpportunityId !== undefined) {\n        itemMap['GIG'+gig.OpportunityId]= gig;\n    }\n});\n\ngigItemsArray = gigItemsArray.map(gig=>{\n  return {\n      ...itemMap['GIG'+gig.OpportunityId],\n      relevanceScore: gig.relevanceScore,\n      explanation: gig.explanation\n  };\n});\n\ncoursesArray = coursesArray.map(course=>{\n  return {\n      ...itemMap['COURSE'+course.learningItemId],\n      relevanceScore: course.relevanceScore,\n      explanation: course.explanation\n  };\n});\n\nfinalObject.gigs = gigItemsArray;\nfinalObject.courses = coursesArray;\nreturn finalObject;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "end"
          },
          "code": "ADD_ATTRIBUTES",
          "id": "1765532186703",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
